Object.assign(AUDIO_BY_TEXT, {"Good evening, everyone, and welcome to this warm and intimate wedding celebration!":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Tonight, in this lovely garden restaurant, only our closest family and friends are here.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Thank you for coming to share this small but truly special day with Thu Ha and Minh Quan.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","My name is Thanh Vân, and I am so happy to host this cozy evening for our two families.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Please relax, enjoy the soft music, and feel at home with us tonight.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Thu Ha and Minh Quan first met at a small coffee shop in Da Nang, on a rainy afternoon.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","From that simple meeting, their love grew slowly, gently, and beautifully.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Tonight, the people in this room are the ones who watched that love grow.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","To our dear parents, thank you for your love, your patience, and your blessing today.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","And to our close friends, thank you for traveling here to stand beside them.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","And now, please welcome Thu Ha and Minh Quan as they walk in together, hand in hand.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Minh Quan, please take Thu Ha's hand and share your vows with her now.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Those words were so sincere. Let us give this lovely couple a warm round of applause.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Now, we would love to hear a few warm words from Thu Ha's mother.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","And here comes the sweetest part: the couple will cut their small wedding cake together.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","What a warm and lovely evening it has been, full of smiles, hugs, and happy tears.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","On behalf of Thu Ha and Minh Quan, thank you for your love, your gifts, and your presence.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","May their life together be as warm and peaceful as this garden tonight.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Please take care on your way home, and carry this sweet evening in your hearts.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Good night, everyone, and thank you for making this small wedding so unforgettable!":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Good evening, ladies and gentlemen, and welcome to a truly spectacular wedding by the sea!":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Tonight, under the lights of this beautiful beach resort in Da Nang, luxury meets love.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","My name is Thanh Vân, and it is my great honor to host this grand celebration.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Please take your seats, enjoy the ocean breeze, and prepare for an unforgettable night.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Ladies and gentlemen, the evening we have all been waiting for begins now!":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Please welcome our radiant bride, Khanh Vy, and our handsome groom, Gia Bao!":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Khanh Vy and Gia Bao met while studying abroad, and their love crossed oceans to bring them home.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Tonight, we are honored to welcome their families and our distinguished VIP guests.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","A special welcome to our honored guests from near and far, who traveled so far to be here.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Please give the couple and their families the warmest applause of the night!":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","And now, the moment we have all awaited: the wedding ceremony begins beneath the flowers.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Khanh Vy and Gia Bao, please exchange your rings as a symbol of your love forever.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Congratulations! Now, please share your first kiss as husband and wife!":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Ladies and gentlemen, please enjoy the couple's first dance, with our live band playing softly.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","And now, the champagne tower! Please raise your glasses as the golden bubbles flow.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","What a dazzling evening it has been, full of music, light, and love.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","As fireworks light up the sky, let us celebrate Khanh Vy and Gia Bao once more!":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","On behalf of both families, thank you for joining this grand celebration tonight.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","May their journey together be as bright and beautiful as the fireworks above us.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Good night, everyone, and thank you for a truly luxurious and unforgettable wedding!":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Good evening, ladies and gentlemen, and welcome to the year-end celebration of Song Han Travel!":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Tonight we look back on a wonderful year of journeys, friendships, and unforgettable moments.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Tonight, our staff and partners gather in this grand ballroom to celebrate together.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","My name is Thanh Vân, and it is my joy to host this special evening with you.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Please settle in, enjoy the music, and let us celebrate together all evening long.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","This year, Song Han Travel welcomed thousands of travelers to Da Nang and beyond.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","From sunny beaches to mountain tours, our team worked hard in every season.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","None of this success would be possible without the dedication of every staff member.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Please join me in thanking our guides, drivers, and office team for a wonderful year.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","And now, let us look back at the best moments of the year on the screen.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","And now, from our memories of the year, we move to the moment we have all been waiting for: the awards.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Our first award goes to the partner who brought us the most travelers this year.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Congratulations to our winner! Please come forward and receive your award.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Before our next award, let us enjoy a short performance from our talented team.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Dinner is now served, so please raise your glasses for a toast to the new year!":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","What a joyful evening it has been, full of awards, music, and wonderful people.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Thank you to every guest, every partner, and every member of the Song Han Travel family.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","May the new year bring you safe journeys, good health, and many happy adventures.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","We wish you and your families health, happiness, and success in the year ahead.":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","Good night, everyone, and see you on our next journey together!":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,"});
